---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Support Now">
  <section class="page-intro">
    <div class="container split-intro">
      <div>
        <p class="eyebrow">Support Now</p>
        <h1>Start with safety and steadiness.</h1>
        <p class="lede">Use this page when fear, grief, conflict, or urgency is making it hard to think clearly.</p>
      </div>
      <aside class="intro-panel">
        <strong>Important limit</strong>
        <p>AfterFaith Guide is educational. It is not therapy, medical advice, legal advice, crisis counseling, or clergy counseling.</p>
      </aside>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="section compact">
    <div class="container support-grid">
      <div class="notice urgent">If you are in immediate danger or may harm yourself or someone else, contact local emergency services or a crisis line in your country.</div>
      <div class="support-block">
        <h2>Right now</h2>
        <ul>
          <li>Move to a safer place if you can.</li>
          <li>Contact emergency services if someone may be harmed.</li>
          <li>Reach out to one steady person who will not pressure you into debate.</li>
          <li>If religious fear or family conflict is escalating, slow the conversation down.</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
      <div class="support-block">
        <h2>When the moment is less urgent</h2>
        <p>Use the resource directory to find peer support, therapist directories, or tradition-specific support that fits your situation.</p>
        <div class="button-row">
          <a class="button" href="/resources?stage=support-now">Browse support resources</a>
          <a class="button secondary" href="/articles/what-makes-a-resource-safer">How to compare resources</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .support-grid {
    display: grid;
    gap: 16px;
    max-width: 900px;
  }

  .support-block {
    background: var(--surface);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 18px;
  }

  .support-block h2 {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .support-block p,
  .support-block li {
    color: var(--muted);
  }

  .urgent {
    font-weight: 750;
  }
</style>
